{
  "asked": "What would Lisbon cost us?",
  "said": "About €426 for two nights with breakfast.",
  "why": "An estimate, called one: the rate it rests on, each line of it, the total, and buttons to change what it assumes. The numbers come from the data, worked out before the surface is written, never typed into words. \"drawn\" is the surface the app is sent.",
  "messages": [
